=head1 DESCRIPTION

Information about a scheduled configuration change for an OpenSearch
Service domain. This actions can be a service software update
(https://docs.aws.amazon.com/opensearch-service/latest/developerguide/service-software.html)
or a blue/green Auto-Tune enhancement
(https://docs.aws.amazon.com/opensearch-service/latest/developerguide/auto-tune.html#auto-tune-types).

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 Cancellable => Bool

Whether or not the scheduled action is cancellable.


=head2 Description => Str

A description of the action to be taken.


=head2 B<REQUIRED> Id => Str

The unique identifier of the scheduled action.


=head2 Mandatory => Bool

Whether the action is required or optional.


=head2 ScheduledBy => Str

Whether the action was scheduled manually (C<CUSTOMER>, or by
OpenSearch Service automatically (C<SYSTEM>).


=head2 B<REQUIRED> ScheduledTime => Int

The time when the change is scheduled to happen.


=head2 B<REQUIRED> Severity => Str

The severity of the action.


=head2 Status => Str

The current status of the scheduled action.


=head2 B<REQUIRED> Type => Str

The type of action that will be taken on the domain.



